Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.41,0:00:22.37,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:25.21,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,They're like little hamburgers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:27.35,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,They're macarons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.35,0:00:29.75,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,And I made lots, so there are plenty \Nmore where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.75,0:00:31.30,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.13,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Oh, and Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.35,0:00:37.09,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It looks like I'm going to \Nbe in another commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.53,0:00:38.97,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Here's the outline.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.97,0:00:41.22,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.22,0:00:43.30,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What's it for this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.30,0:00:45.14,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's some bridal thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.41,0:00:46.53,sign_1089_16_Twitch,sign,0,0,0,,Twitch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.53,0:00:49.27,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What? It's just my usual commercial stuff.
