Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:01:01.51,sign_1331_27_The_Cutest__Anna,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(465,290)\shad2\c&H389CC6&\3c&H152835&\4c&HD2DBDB&\fsp3\fad(254,533)}Beshakuri
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.87,0:01:01.07,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,The one who just said that Red's \Nher favorite member of Gelato 5...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:04.00,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What is it, Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:06.87,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,"Scene 1. The couple enters the chapel."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.31,0:01:06.25,top,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.87,0:01:10.25,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,"Scene 2. They gaze at each \Nother before the priest."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:10.25,top,Fudo,0,0,0,,Hello, Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.25,0:01:13.40,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,"Scene 3. They cut the cake."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:13.40,top,Fudo,0,0,0,,D-Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:17.01,italics,,0,0,0,,Then the line: "For your big \Nday, choose Kishimoto Weddings."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.21,0:01:16.41,top,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.49,0:01:20.53,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.53,0:01:21.50,main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.01,0:01:24.89,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,This is one job that you dare not accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.89,0:01:26.14,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Wh-Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:28.61,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,But I have to, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:31.19,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,The rest of the team turned them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.82,0:01:35.17,flashback,Hayato,0,0,0,,My fans would be distraught to \Nsee me in a commercial like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.17,0:01:36.40,flashback,Hayato,0,0,0,,I'll pass, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:39.49,flashback,Daigo,0,0,0,,It's incompatible with my image.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.49,0:01:42.14,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,So I'm the only one left!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.14,0:01:43.37,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Well, you can't do it, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:45.42,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you, Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.35,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You've never been this selfish before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.45,0:01:49.88,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Selfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:51.87,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,This is my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:52.96,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,How can I—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:01:54.20,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fine, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:57.13,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Go cut your cake with Hashi-An or whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:01:59.14,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Wait, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.56,0:02:00.84,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.89,0:02:04.19,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What in the world happened there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.19,0:02:06.34,main,Haru,0,0,0,,I heard everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.40,0:02:08.46,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Haru-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:10.40,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's not nice to eavesdrop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:12.38,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,But yes, please tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:14.65,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Why is Desumi-san so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.15,0:02:17.05,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's just a commercial!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:18.39,main,Haru,0,0,0,,"Just a commercial..."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.39,0:02:20.11,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Yet it {\i1}is{\i0} a commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.87,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Try to imagine it, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.87,0:02:27.62,main,Haru,0,0,0,,The person you most love, cutting a\N cake with a total stranger...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.76,0:02:30.45,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Cutting a cake...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.56,0:02:35.75,sign_5871_55_Missing,sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur2}Guahhh!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.07,0:02:38.01,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Do you grasp it now, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.05,0:02:43.47,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What an incorrigible fool I've been!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.47,0:02:45.76,main,Haru,0,0,0,,You can still make it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.22,0:02:49.14,main,Prof,0,0,0,,What's all this, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:49.14,sign_4017_76_Thump,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(430,20)\t(1,856,\fs30)}Thump
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.45,0:02:52.77,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I just realized that I can't \Ndo the cake-cutting scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:54.65,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Please, let me withdraw from the commercial!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:57.40,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Why can't you do the cake-cutting scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:58.51,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Nothing doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.51,0:03:01.53,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Kishimoto Weddings is a \Nvery important sponsor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:02.97,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.97,0:03:03.78,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.14,0:03:05.93,main,Prof,0,0,0,,All right, Fudo-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.22,0:03:08.66,sign_4465_86_Combined_Weapon_,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(285,30)\fad(1217,1)}Combined Weapon Proposal
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:07.70,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.70,0:03:12.14,main,Prof,0,0,0,,The combined weapon made up \Nfrom your individual weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:16.57,main,Prof,0,0,0,,has been stalled for a while \Ndue to lack of funding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.57,0:03:20.01,main,Prof,0,0,0,,But just the other day, it became reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.01,0:03:22.51,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Thanks to their large contribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.06,0:03:27.74,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Although it's just a commercial, it's an \Nimportant part of our fight for world peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:29.86,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Please don't be unreasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:33.26,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,For the sake of world peace...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.81,0:03:38.06,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,But is it worth making Desumi-san unhappy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:39.79,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,I made lots!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:41.82,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.87,0:03:44.20,main,Prof,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:46.25,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'll make my own cake
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:51.58,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,and do my first cake-cutting with Desumi \Nbefore the commercial is filmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:53.08,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:55.00,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.89,0:04:12.14,sign_5992_103_Fudo,sign,0,0,0,,{\move(230,50,225,48)\frz-17.13}Fudo
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.89,0:04:12.14,sign_5992_103_Fudo,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HB5AC96&\bord0\frz-17.25\move(200,210,190,215)\t(1,2250,\fsp1.3)}You have no new messages
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:18.67,main,Combatant A,0,0,0,,I ain't goin' in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.67,0:04:19.90,main,Combatant B,0,0,0,,Too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.35,0:04:22.00,main,Beast,0,0,0,,What's all this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:24.27,main,Combatant,0,0,0,,W-Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.78,0:04:27.53,sign_6349_109_Menacing,sign,0,0,0,,Menacing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.63,0:04:29.54,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:31.50,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Reaper-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:36.02,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,He hasn't called me in two whole days!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:38.13,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Stupid, stupid, stupid Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:42.76,italics,Gekko Announcer,0,0,0,,All squad leaders and \NPrincess Series members,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.01,0:04:45.38,italics,Gekko Announcer,0,0,0,,report to the conference room at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.55,0:04:54.64,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Your attention, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:56.90,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,The time is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:05:01.48,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,This is the birth of our greatest \Nmonster yet, the Ultimate Phantom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:03.82,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,For the sake of any viewers \Nwho may have forgotten,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:06.32,sign_5517_46_Allow_me_to_expl,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur4\an8}Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:06.32,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,allow me to explain once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:08.09,sign_19031_220_Negative,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,436)}Negative
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:09.93,sign_19031_221_Negative_Energy,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz-6.38\pos(535,60)\fad(1,476)}Negative Energy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:10.71,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Secret Society Gekko is trying to use \Nthe negative energy emitted by humans
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.55,0:05:16.58,sign_19031_221_Negative_Energy,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz11.98\pos(95,210)\fscx90\fad(295,1)}Ultimate Phantom
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:15.47,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,to fuel the creation of the Ultimate \NPhantom, their greatest monster yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.62,main,Snake,0,0,0,,Hey, about dang time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.62,0:05:24.09,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,It is your diligent efforts that \Nhave made this day possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:27.84,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Behold! It's filled to the \Nbrim with negative energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:31.10,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Now, let us celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.09,0:05:35.62,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Celebrate... Cake...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:37.89,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Cutting a cake...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.85,0:05:42.92,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,At last, our plans for world \Ndomination will bear fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:47.79,main,Beast,0,0,0,,I feel you, Reaper Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.79,0:05:49.74,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Our day is finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:53.01,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Stupid Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:56.16,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Now, awaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:06:03.15,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Our greatest monster, Ultimate Phantom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:05.63,sign_219_3_Ultimate,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs21\bord4\t(1232,1775,\3c&HFEFFFC&)}Ultimate
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.58,0:06:21.19,main,Ultimate,0,0,0,,Pucka-pucka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.63,0:06:25.27,main,Ultimate,0,0,0,,Goo-goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:29.50,main,Ultimate,0,0,0,,Pucka-pucka. Pucka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:31.54,main,Steel,0,0,0,,It's not quite what I'd imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.58,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Looks pretty weak to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:36.25,main,Blood,0,0,0,,Is it... a failure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:38.04,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,I-It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:41.63,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,I created you for but one purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:44.96,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Destroy humanity and bring \Nabout our dream of—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:51.02,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Owie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:57.56,main,Bear,0,0,0,,Wh-What in the world?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.31,0:06:58.14,top,Blood,0,0,0,,Bosslar-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:04.45,main,Bear,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:06.33,main,Eagle,0,0,0,,Is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:07.15,main,Drone,0,0,0,,...out of control?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:15.41,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Why... Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:18.20,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Ultimate Phantom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:20.96,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Bad little boys who don't do as they're told
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.18,0:07:23.46,main,Beast,0,0,0,,need punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.69,0:07:34.05,sign_10806_159_Major_Yikes_Kann,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur2\alphaFF\t(1,80,\alpha00)}Major {\alphaFF\t(260,343,\alpha00)}Yikes {\alphaFF\t(510,594,\alpha00)}Kannonflame
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.95,0:07:40.98,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Right here, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:46.48,sign_5871_55_Missing,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Rampaging Lion Claws
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:46.48,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Rampaging Lion Claws!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.96,main,Blood,0,0,0,,Bloody Slicer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.75,0:07:48.96,sign_5871_55_Missing,sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H8C1F83&\blur2}Bloody Slicer
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:53.41,main,Judgment,0,0,0,,Duàn Zuì Liè Lún!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:53.41,sign_5871_55_Missing,sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H64CF1B&\blur2}Duàn Zuì Liè Lún
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.41,0:08:02.15,main,Beast,0,0,0,,How d'you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:10.76,main,Bear,0,0,0,,Step aside, Princess Series!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.75,0:08:12.01,main,Bear,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:29.40,main,Bear,0,0,0,,Did we do it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.81,0:08:33.66,main,Bear,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:35.32,main,Bear,0,0,0,,It did nothing—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:45.74,main,Steel,0,0,0,,C-Culverin Bear-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.74,0:08:46.83,main,Beast,0,0,0,,It ate him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:51.17,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:02.06,main,Beast,0,0,0,,It integrates whatever it eats?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.61,0:09:09.50,main,Beast,0,0,0,,N-Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:30.75,sign_13628_179_Desumi_Fudo,sign,0,0,0,,Desumi\NFudo
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:36.17,sign_13758_180_Radiance,sign,0,0,0,,Radiance
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.42,0:09:36.17,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.17,0:09:40.18,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Fudo-kun, it's time to head to the shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:41.65,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:53.54,main,Hashi-An,0,0,0,,Fudo-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:54.99,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Hashimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:10:00.99,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Hey! What's with you, Reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.99,0:10:03.44,main,Steel,0,0,0,,It ate Bear-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:05.91,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Oh, for... Can someone \Nhere get real already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:10.42,main,Beast,0,0,0,,It's heading for the city! \NWe have to go after it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:16.42,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Please... pick up, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.23,0:10:18.65,main,Judgment,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.65,0:10:20.39,main,Drone,0,0,0,,Ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:22.89,main,Drone,0,0,0,,Yes, thanks. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:23.01,sign_14935_193_Fudo,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz32.47\pos(305,125)}Fudo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:23.14,sign_14935_193_Fudo,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz32.47\pos(311,125)}Fudo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:23.26,sign_14935_193_Fudo,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz32.47\pos(300,113)}Fudo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:24.64,sign_14935_193_Fudo,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz32.47\pos(305,125)}Fudo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:28.64,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:31.89,main,Snake,0,0,0,,Sheesh, what a mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:40.91,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What a fool I've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:48.36,main,Director,0,0,0,,Fudo-kun, I'd really like to start the shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:50.67,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,R-Right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.54,0:10:56.40,sign_14935_193_Fudo,sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2}Desumi-san\N{\fs20}Calling
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:53.88,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.02,0:11:03.38,main,Hashi-An,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:07.62,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:08.89,main,Hashi-An,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.42,0:11:11.64,main,Hashi-An,0,0,0,,Then I hope we can get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.91,0:11:17.15,main,Director,0,0,0,,Time for Scene 3, cutting the cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:23.28,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's begun at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:24.36,main,Director,0,0,0,,Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:40.02,main,Hashi-An,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Fudo-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:41.13,main,Hashi-An,0,0,0,,You're holding it too hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:45.56,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:50.15,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I can only cut my first cake with Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:10.00,main,Ultimate,0,0,0,,Pucka-pucka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:13.02,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,What is that monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:19.67,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,I'm currently over a wedding venue \Nwhere an explosion just occurred!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.67,0:12:26.80,sign_17735_218_BREAKING_City_We,sign,0,0,0,,{\move(380,65,375,75)\fs8.5\t(1,7130,\fs8)\frx20\fry2}BREAKING\N{\c&HB3B6AA&\3c&HF8FAF8&}CITY WEDDING VENUE\N{\c&HB7A7E5&}SUDDEN EXPLOSION
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.25,0:12:21.44,italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.44,0:12:23.28,italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,The smoke hasn't even settled!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.28,0:12:26.80,italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,We can't tell if it's an accident \Nor intentional at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.10,0:12:31.90,italicstop,Reporter,0,0,0,,But it's dangerous to be in the area, \Nso we implore everyone to stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:33.13,main,Judgment,0,0,0,,The explosion appears to be \Nthe work of Ultimate Phantom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.13,0:12:35.78,italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,I'm getting new information now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:41.77,italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,It seems Fudo Aikawa of Gelato 5\N was filming at this venue!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:45.70,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:48.70,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You need to get to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.31,0:12:50.87,main,Hashi-An,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:57.69,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Is this a new Gekko monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:13:00.59,main,Ultimate,0,0,0,,Destroy... humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:07.09,sign_13628_179_Desumi_Fudo,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HCED5C8&\3c&H2E2A3C&}Desumi\NFudo
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:07.09,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,The cake I made for Desumi-san and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:09.85,main,Daigo,0,0,0,,Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:10.83,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:14.86,main,Daigo,0,0,0,,Did you really just turn \Nyour back on the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:17.06,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get transformed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.89,0:13:19.66,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Hey... were you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.66,0:13:21.40,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,C-Certainly not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:26.09,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Let's go! Time to transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.09,0:13:32.54,main,Team,0,0,0,,Freezing Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:34.29,italics,Changer,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.65,0:13:36.16,italics,Changer,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.16,0:13:37.37,italics,Changer,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.37,0:13:38.44,italics,Changer,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:39.29,italics,Changer,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:44.30,italics,Changer,0,0,0,,Change Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:47.93,main,Red,0,0,0,,The aroma of strawberry, \Nthe flavor of justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:49.82,main,Red,0,0,0,,Red Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.85,0:13:53.68,main,Blue,0,0,0,,The aroma of soda, the flavor of courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.33,0:13:56.31,main,Blue,0,0,0,,Blue Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:13:59.44,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,The aroma of lemon, the flavor of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.87,0:14:01.54,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,Yellow Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:05.19,main,Pink,0,0,0,,The aroma of peach, the flavor of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.93,0:14:07.82,main,Pink,0,0,0,,Pink Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.31,0:14:11.32,main,Green,0,0,0,,The aroma of pistachio, the flavor of peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.63,0:14:13.14,main,Green,0,0,0,,Green Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:15.70,main,Gelato 5,0,0,0,,Together, we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:19.21,main,Gelato 5,0,0,0,,Freezing Sentai Gelato 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.21,0:14:24.30,main,Red,0,0,0,,Underestimate us on pain of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:43.54,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,Here's one for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:47.51,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,Megaton Lemon Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.31,0:14:53.62,main,Pink,0,0,0,,Misaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:55.54,main,Pink,0,0,0,,Let go of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:58.26,main,Pink,0,0,0,,Sky Peach Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.33,0:15:02.61,main,Blue,0,0,0,,Right over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:06.74,main,Blue,0,0,0,,Twin Soda Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.06,0:15:19.10,main,Red,0,0,0,,Sweet Berry Impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.77,0:15:21.48,main,Red,0,0,0,,Daigo-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:23.56,main,Green,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:28.74,main,Green,0,0,0,,Vacuum Pistachio Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:33.03,main,Green,0,0,0,,Your ferocity is truly admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.03,0:15:34.75,main,Green,0,0,0,,I only wish we could have \Nmet under different—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.83,0:15:43.00,main,Red,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:46.59,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,The building's coming down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:50.09,italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,Are our heroes safe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.61,0:15:50.09,top,Fudo's Mother,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:51.72,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,L-Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:53.82,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,The fight isn't over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:57.16,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,And the giant monster \Nseems completely unharmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:15:59.31,main,Green,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.31,0:16:02.82,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,And it looks like our heroes \Nhave taken quite a beating...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:04.98,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,How in the world is this going to turn out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:11.37,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Finally caught up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.99,0:16:14.99,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,It looks like Gekko reinforcements \Nhave just arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:17.68,italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,Not only are they facing a ferocious monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:17.68,top,Desumi's Father,0,0,0,,Here's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.87,italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,but the Princess Series \Nhave also joined the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.87,top,Kids,0,0,0,,Go, Gekko!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:23.80,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,This might be the greatest \Ncrisis Gelato 5 has ever faced!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.78,0:16:27.93,main,Steel,0,0,0,,You'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:30.01,main,Steel,0,0,0,,You'll pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.44,0:16:36.06,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Iron Prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.65,0:16:37.05,sign_5871_55_Missing,sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&HBF5243&\blur2\fad(177,1)}Iron {\alphaFF\t(635,761,\alpha00)}Prison
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:39.85,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Oh! There seems to be some \Nin-fighting going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:40.97,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,What could be the cause of it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.97,0:16:43.69,main,Beast,0,0,0,,I'll slice you to ribbons!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.31,0:16:55.53,main,Beast,0,0,0,,S-Steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.05,0:17:07.42,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Y-You damned monster...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.85,0:17:12.73,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,It appears Gekko doesn't have \Ncontrol of this monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.21,0:17:15.68,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.71,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,It's devouring the cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.71,0:17:18.93,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,It just does whatever it wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:25.73,main,Red,0,0,0,,This thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.73,0:17:28.01,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,The monster's appearance is changing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.10,0:17:36.26,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.78,0:17:43.29,sign_13628_179_Desumi_Fudo,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HA9A0BE&\3c&H2E2A3C&}Desumi\NFudo
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.05,0:17:55.64,main,Blue,0,0,0,,That thing is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:17:59.36,main,Red,0,0,0,,Red here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.36,0:18:01.66,italics,Prof,0,0,0,,Fudo-kun, hold it horizontal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:03.62,italics,Prof,0,0,0,,Fudo-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:05.27,italics,Prof,0,0,0,,We're left with no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.27,0:18:08.52,italics,Prof,0,0,0,,It'll be quite a test run, but you'll \Nhave to use that weapon we discussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.03,0:18:11.90,italics,Prof,0,0,0,,The Combiner Sword, Gelato Claymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:15.51,italics,Prof,0,0,0,,That weapon will surely defeat the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.51,0:18:17.42,italics,Prof,0,0,0,,Everyone, combine your weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.90,0:18:23.90,main,Red,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.74,0:18:25.79,main,Team,0,0,0,,Combine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:40.97,main,Team,0,0,0,,Complete! Gelato Claymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.31,0:18:44.07,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Are you seeing this, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.07,0:18:47.18,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Gelato 5's weapons, and their hearts...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:48.35,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,are united!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:53.22,main,Red,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:57.61,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Blue, Green, Pink, and \NYellow have been captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.88,0:19:04.29,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Red's wound appears quite serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.29,0:19:06.87,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,What in the world will happen next?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.87,0:19:08.67,main,Red,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.59,0:19:16.38,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.37,0:19:18.34,main,Blue,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.94,0:19:21.48,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Reaper Princess joins the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:23.38,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,I can't believe what I'm seeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.38,0:19:26.72,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Those two eternal rivals... \Nworking as a team?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.30,0:19:28.73,main,Red,0,0,0,,Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.67,0:19:31.73,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for being selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.21,0:19:35.60,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm sure you must hate me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.60,0:19:37.62,main,Red,0,0,0,,I wouldn't. Never ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.62,0:19:40.15,main,Red,0,0,0,,Not even if the heavens fell to the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.61,0:19:42.79,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.47,0:19:44.65,main,Red,0,0,0,,Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.74,0:19:47.35,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,I can't hear what they're saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.35,0:19:50.75,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,but it's easy to imagine it's \Na heated exchange of insults!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.13,0:19:56.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Are you ready, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.59,0:19:58.63,main,Red,0,0,0,,I am, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.40,0:20:25.41,main,Pink,0,0,0,,I know they can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.41,0:20:29.16,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Just do it, Reaper!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:33.16,main,Team,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:36.25,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What? Fudo, is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:38.57,main,Red,0,0,0,,Yes, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.45,0:20:44.76,main,Red& Desumi,0,0,0,,...like we're cutting a cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.07,0:20:56.27,main,Blue,0,0,0,,Heck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:58.73,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Running away with the glory...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.23,0:21:01.69,main,Boys A&B,0,0,0,,They did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:03.49,main,Fudo's Mother,0,0,0,,That's my Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:04.93,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.93,0:21:05.86,main,Kids,0,0,0,,Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.95,0:21:22.38,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Thank you, Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.83,0:21:25.63,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I would have lost for sure if not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:27.83,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.83,0:21:30.29,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You made us a cake, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.13,0:21:33.11,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'd love to actually eat the next one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.11,0:21:35.27,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Easily provided, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.03,0:21:39.51,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,This child... isn't it that monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.51,0:21:41.07,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.07,0:21:43.50,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It's too small to cause any \Nmore harm now, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:46.03,main,Baby,0,0,0,,Papa! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.03,0:21:47.33,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,R-Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.33,0:21:49.24,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,This appears to be a case \Nof mistaken identity!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.31,0:21:52.51,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Honestly, what a silly baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:54.87,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,After vanquishing the giant monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.87,0:21:56.66,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,has a new friendship sprung up between them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.66,0:21:58.42,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Let's have an interview!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.31,0:22:02.21,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Rondo of the Reaper!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.31,0:22:03.05,sign_5871_55_Missing,sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H95658E&\blur2\fad(175,1)}Rea{\alphaFF\t(384,530,\alpha00)}per {\alphaFF\t(926,1093,\alpha00)}Ro{\alphaFF\t(1260,1427,\alpha00)}n{\alphaFF\t(1593,1760,\alpha00)}do
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.43,0:22:10.18,main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Th-There's no mutual understanding at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.51,0:22:16.18,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,N-Not bad, Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:20.15,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,F-Friendship? Don't be absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.15,0:22:21.69,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I am Reaper Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.69,0:22:24.07,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,The cold and merciless devil incarnate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.07,0:22:25.57,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Never forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:28.45,main,Baby,0,0,0,,Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.42,0:22:39.85,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Let us meet again, De—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.85,0:22:41.04,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.36,0:22:44.93,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A-Any time, Fu—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.93,0:22:46.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Red Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.59,0:22:48.34,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.59,0:22:48.34,sign_5517_46_Allow_me_to_expl,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur4\an8}Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.66,0:22:51.22,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,This is the story of a hero of justice
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.22,0:22:52.60,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and a secret society's combatant
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.60,0:22:55.95,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,walking the road of forbidden love!
